[engl]
{100}{}{Vault 13 Guide}
{200}{}{Vault 13 System Message}
{1000}{}{Predialogue}
{1010}{}{Default}
{2000}{}{Before starting your journey, remember your main goal is to find the Water Chip for Vault 13. Is there anything else you need to know before you leave?}
{2010}{}{How should I handle meeting people out there?}
{2020}{}{What's the rule on taking items and looting?}
{2030}{}{How do I survive and get stronger?}
{2040}{}{I understand. I'm ready to leave.}
{3000}{}{Don't provoke conversations with other characters—be cordial, otherwise they won't like you much! Speak with most people you find, as they can give you valuable information.}
{3010}{}{What about looting?}
{3020}{}{How do I get stronger?}
{3030}{}{Thanks for the advice. I'm ready to leave.}
{4000}{}{Lockers are full of items, but remember: you need permission most of the time to get the loot. If you insist on taking things without asking, people will attack you on sight!}
{4010}{}{How should I talk to people?}
{4020}{}{How do I get stronger?}
{4030}{}{Understood. I'm ready to leave.}
{5000}{}{Raise your skills as you travel and seek out professional trainers in towns. As you grow stronger, look into joining a faction for protection and allies. Good luck!}
{5010}{}{Tell me about looting again.}
{5020}{}{Tell me about talking to people again.}
{5030}{}{I'm ready to step outside.}